      "parameters": {
        "width": 1000,
        "height": 230,
        "content": "## WAIX · Заказ → WhatsApp\n1. Server webhook: create Header Auth with X-Workflow-Key and your own secret. Call only from your backend.\n2. WAIX API: create a different Header Auth with Authorization = Bearer <WAIX key>.\n3. Prepare request: set your connection/template for messages. OTP uses a project key; start with sandbox.\n4. Use a persistent event_id UUID per operation. Never expose either secret in browser code.\n5. Execution history is disabled to avoid retaining phone numbers and OTP codes. Activate only after a test.\nSee https://waix.kz/integrations/n8n"
      }
